{"seq":2,"slug":"experiments","title":"第二章：故障注入实验设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/experiments","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fault-injection-types","title":"故障注入类型分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/experiments/fault-injection-types","wordCount":635,"readingTime":3},{"seq":2,"slug":"experiment-design","title":"混沌实验场景设计方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/experiments/experiment-design","wordCount":801,"readingTime":4},{"seq":3,"slug":"gameday-runbooks","title":"GameDay 演练组织与故障响应剧本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/experiments/gameday-runbooks","wordCount":685,"readingTime":3}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"第二章-故障注入实验设计\">第二章：故障注入实验设计</h1><p>本章介绍混沌实验的具体设计方法：如何分类故障类型、如何系统性地设计实验场景、以及如何组织 GameDay 演练活动。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章文档\">本章文档</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>核心主题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"fault-injection-types\">故障注入类型分类</a></td>\n<td>CPU/内存/网络/进程/磁盘各类故障的注入方式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"experiment-design\">实验场景设计方法</a></td>\n<td>假说驱动的实验设计、优先级矩阵、场景库建设</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"gameday-runbooks\">GameDay 演练组织</a></td>\n<td>演练计划、角色分工、故障响应剧本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"设计原则\">设计原则</h2><p>好的混沌实验应该像好的单元测试一样：聚焦单一故障类型、有清晰的验证指标、可重复执行、并在发现问题后留下可执行的改进项。</p>\n"}